{"step_index":151,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T15:33:47Z","input_tokens":19879,"cache_read_tokens":172948,"output_tokens":1348,"content":"I have redesigned the **CivicSync Municipal Dashboard** into an enterprise-grade command center.\n\nInstead of crowding all features into a single cramped page, the interface is now structured into dedicated, purpose-built operational workspaces with modern command-center aesthetics.\n\n---\n\n### Key Redesign Improvements\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Header[\"App Navigation & Role Bar<br/>(Agra & Jodhpur Live Stream · Role & City Selector)\"]\n    \n    Header --> Triage[\"📋 Triage Queue & Drawer<br/>• KPI Metric Cards<br/>• ⚡ Fast Lane 1-Click Batch Verify<br/>• Slide-Over Ticket Drawer<br/>• Explainable Formula Breakdown\"]\n    Header --> GIS[\"🗺️ Full-Screen GIS Density Map<br/>• PostGIS ST_SnapToGrid 250m Cells<br/>• Interactive Hazard Markers<br/>• Deprecation-Proof Heat Clusters\"]\n    Header --> Dup[\"⚠️ Duplicate Resolution Hub<br/>• Side-by-Side 25m–50m Review<br/>• Distance Delta Badges<br/>• 1-Click Merge & Corroboration Bonus\"]\n    Header --> SLA[\"⏱️ SLA & Escalations Center<br/>• Mon–Sat 10:00–17:00 IST Working Clocks<br/>• L1 / L2 / L3 Escalation Tiers<br/>• Overdue Crew Alerts\"]\n    Header --> Analytics[\"📊 Executive City Analytics<br/>• Class Distribution Doughnut Chart<br/>• Weekly Resolution Velocity Bar Chart<br/>• Full Pilot Dataset CSV Export\"]\n```\n\n---\n\n### What Changed\n\n1. **Multi-View Top Navigation**:\n   - 📋 **Triage Queue**: Dedicated queue with dynamic gradient score badges (Critical, High, Medium, Low), SLA countdown progress bars, and search/filter toolbars.\n   - 🗺️ **GIS Density Map**: Full-screen GIS map showing deprecation-proof `ST_SnapToGrid` 250m density cells and ticket markers for Agra and Jodhpur.\n   - ⚠️ **Duplicate Resolution Hub**: Split-screen side-by-side comparison for 25m–50m duplicate candidates with distance delta indicators and 1-click merge/separate actions.\n   - ⏱️ **SLA & Escalation Center**: Operational monitor tracking stage deadlines against municipal working hours, showing elapsed percentages and L1/L2/L3 tiers.\n   - 📊 **Executive Analytics**: Visual data charts powered by Chart.js (hazard class distribution and resolution velocity) with one-click CSV export.\n\n2. **Slide-Over Inspection Drawer**:\n   - High-resolution photo preview with on-device privacy shield tag.\n   - Transparent formula breakdown card showing exact values for $(0.30 \\cdot C + 0.25 \\cdot E + 0.15 \\cdot K + 0.30 \\cdot L) + B$.\n   - Plain-language *\"Why this rank?\"* explanation string.\n   - Action transition center enforcing mandatory after-photos before resolving tickets and standardized rejection reasons.\n   - Citizen corroboration audit timeline.\n\n3. **Modern Visual Polish**:\n   - Enterprise typography (`Plus Jakarta Sans` and `JetBrains Mono`).\n   - Refined color system with high-contrast status pills and subtle shadows.\n   - Interactive role switcher (Ward Officer, Crew Lead, Zonal Engineer, City Admin).\n\n---\n\n### How to View the Redesigned Dashboard\n\n- **In Your Web Browser**:\n  Open the file directly:\n  > [`C:\\Users\\ashmi\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\civicsync\\apps\\dashboard\\index.html`](file:///c:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/civicsync/apps/dashboard/index.html)\n\n- **As an Artifact in Antigravity**:\n  You can also inspect the dashboard artifact directly in the side pane:\n  > [`civicsync_dashboard.html`](file:///C:/Users/ashmi/.gemini/antigravity/brain/c0a61ba8-08bb-4406-b242-fe95667a7a7e/civicsync_dashboard.html)","thinking":"Dashboard functionality requires verification following the multi-view architecture update. The update includes a triage queue with key features like KPI metrics and a searchable filter, alongside a full-screen GIS density map showing ticket density for Agra and Jodhpur, and these changes need to be tested.\n\n\n"}
